Description: development files for libkf6attica6
 Attica is a Qt library that implements the Open Collaboration Services
 API version 1.6 and provides access to persons, contents and other OCS
 resources.
 .
 This package contains the development headers, CMake package metadata and
 pkg-config metadata for KDE Frameworks 6 Attica.

Package: libkf6attica-doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Section: doc
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: Qt library that implements the Open Collaboration Services API (documentation)
 Attica is a Qt library that implements the Open Collaboration Services
 API version 1.6 and provides access to persons, contents and other OCS
 resources.
 .
 This compatibility package reserves the KDE Frameworks 6 Attica
 documentation package contract. QDoc output is not part of Attica's default
 upstream build and is not generated in this package profile.

